{
  "$block": "page-shell",
  "$scope": "page",
  "$styleOverlay": null,
  "$description": "The MANDATORY outermost wrapper for every page-level form. A borderless, heading-less card carrying the `sha-page` class. EVERY other component on the page goes inside its `content.components` — nothing sits beside it at root. Derived from the approved boxfusion.test/bookings-table revision 2.",
  "$slots": {
    "content": "subtree.content.components — the entire page body goes here, in order"
  },
  "$bindings": [],
  "$validatedAgainst": [
    "card:bg/border/radius/shadow — v3, proven live on bookings-table",
    "card:hideHeading — suppresses the card title row so the shell is invisible chrome",
    "card:className — `sha-page` is the app-level page class the portal styles against"
  ],
  "$notes": [
    "Border is removed on ALL THREE breakpoints here. The source revision only set style:'none' on desktop and left tablet/mobile (and base) on style:'solid' #d9d9d9 — since breakpoint blocks override base per-key, that renders a visible 1px border on tablet and mobile. Corrected deliberately; revert only if the border is wanted there.",
    "height is 'auto' + minHeight 'fit-content' here. The source revision carries a fixed height:'30px' on all three breakpoints, which is wrong for a wrapper holding a whole page and risks clipping or an inner scrollbar. Corrected deliberately.",
    "className is set on the base node AND every breakpoint. The source set it on base + desktop only.",
    "DELIBERATE CONVENTION DEVIATION: this block carries literal hexes (#fff, #d9d9d9, #000) rather than $role tokens, so validate-blocks.js emits 16 'colour belongs in the design-system overlay' WARNs (4 colours x base + 3 breakpoints). That is expected and must not be 'fixed' by tokenising. The overlay is applied as a separate pass, and a separate pass is a pass that gets skipped — which is why forms keep shipping as default AntD. A page shell that is only correct once someone remembers to run the overlay is not a page shell. Warnings never fail the build; these are the record of the choice, not a defect."
  ],
  "subtree": {
    "type": "card",
    "version": 3,
    "propertyName": "pageShell",
    "componentName": "pageShell",
    "label": "Page",
    "labelAlign": "right",
    "hidden": false,
    "isDynamic": false,
    "hideHeading": true,
    "className": "sha-page",
    "enableStyleOnReadonly": false,
    "stylingBox": "{\"marginBottom\":\"5\"}",
    "container": {},
    "header": {
      "id": "$slot:pageShellHeader",
      "components": []
    },
    "content": {
      "id": "$slot:pageShellContent",
      "components": []
    },
    "border": {
      "hideBorder": false,
      "radiusType": "all",
      "borderType": "all",
      "border": {
        "all": { "width": "1px", "style": "none", "color": "#d9d9d9" },
        "top": {},
        "bottom": {},
        "left": {},
        "right": {}
      },
      "radius": { "all": 8 }
    },
    "background": {
      "type": "color",
      "color": "#fff",
      "repeat": "no-repeat",
      "size": "cover",
      "position": "center",
      "gradient": { "direction": "to right", "colors": {} },
      "url": "",
      "storedFile": { "id": null },
